<h1>Terms and Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="mute">Version 2026-11-14. This is an unofficial fan site, not affiliated with Dunn Games or Roblox.</p>

<h2>1. Who can use the auction</h2>
<p>You must be 16 or older. You need an account with a verified email address to post listings and comments. One person, one account. Keep your password private; we will never ask for it.</p>

<h2>2. What the auction is</h2>
<p>The auction is a message board where players post items with a title, one image and a description. It does not hold items or coins, and it does not guarantee any trade. You trade at your own risk, and we are not responsible for scams, losses or disputes between players.</p>

<h2>3. Rules</h2>
<p>Do not post anything illegal, hateful, sexual, threatening, or aimed at harassing others. No scams, no fake listings, no asking for passwords or login details, no selling accounts, and no real-money or Robux trading outside what the game itself allows. Do not post personal information about yourself or others. Only upload images you have the right to use, and keep them to Farming and Friends content.</p>

<h2>4. Moderation</h2>
<p>Admins can remove any listing or comment and can ban accounts at any time, with or without notice. Admin actions are recorded in a log. Rate limits apply to stop spam.</p>

<h2>5. Passwords</h2>
<p>Passwords are stored hashed by our database provider, and nobody, including admins, can see them. There is no self-service password reset. Ask in the Discord and an admin will help after checking who you are.</p>

<h2>6. What data we collect</h2>
<p>Your email address, username, password hash, the time you accepted these terms, and the content you post (titles, descriptions, images, comments). Our hosting providers also keep normal technical logs (such as IP addresses) for security. We use this data only to run the auction, prevent abuse and contact you about your account. We do not sell it or use it for ads.</p>

<h2>7. Who processes your data</h2>
<p>Supabase (database, login and image storage) and Cloudflare Turnstile (captcha) process data on our behalf. The calculator page itself has no tracking and makes no outside requests.</p>

<h2>8. Keeping and deleting data</h2>
<p>We keep your data while your account exists. You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, or delete your account, by messaging <b>@pxd8</b> on Discord. Deleting an account removes its listings and comments. Public posts are visible to anyone who visits the auction page.</p>

<h2>9. Changes and contact</h2>
<p>We may update these terms. If we do, you will be asked to accept the new version. Questions: <b>@pxd8</b> on Discord.</p>
